@prefix ex: <urn:review:> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

ex:Model a owl:Ontology ; owl:versionInfo "1.0.0" .
ex:Document a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "资料"@zh .
ex:PolicyDocument a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Document ; rdfs:label "制度资料"@zh .
ex:Person a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "复核人"@zh .
ex:state a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Document ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
ex:weightKg a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Document ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
ex:reviewedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Document ; rdfs:range ex:Person .
